  "label": {
    "en": [
      "Color postcard showing a central square with landscaped flowerbeds and benches. A tall church with a clocked spire dominates the view; another older tower rises behind it. The reverse has a Romanian 40 bani stamp and Poșta Română cancellations from 31.08.1975, printed caption indicating Abrud's 9 May Square, and a handwritten Romanian message addressed to Focșani."
